// stdlib/net.amb
// Networking: minimal HTTP/1.0 client implemented as VM natives.
// Only http:// URLs are supported (no TLS). All functions are fail-soft
// and return "" on any network/parsing failure, like readFile.

// httpGet(url) : String — response body, or "" on failure.
print httpGet("http://127.0.0.1:8123/hello")

// httpPost(url, body) : String — POSTs body, returns response body or "".
print httpPost("http://127.0.0.1:8123/echo", "hello server")
